  biomeName: Brine Rivers
  minDepthMeters: 6125
  maxDepthMeters: 6650
  shortDescription: Hyper-saline underwater lakes in deep depressions.
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Deep-pressure biome. Come here with purpose, stronger gear, and a
    plan to work around bowls, pools, and local hotspots.
  commonRewardHook: Even routine value here comes from Electrolyte Salts and Hydrocarbon
    Resin.
  rareRewardHook: 'The reason to risk the trip is: Sulfur Clumps and Pump Rotor.'
  landmarkIdentity: Brine Rivers reads through bowls, pools, domes, and hotspot basins.
    Landmarks should feel scarce but memorable.
  safePocketIdentity: 'Safe pockets are short-lived and mostly procedural: a lee
    side, a bowl edge, a dead current seam.'
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: localized danger pockets and hostile basins, depth
    stress, and expensive hesitation. Creature pressure stays high.'
  extractionFocus: 'Harvest concentrated hotspots, then move before the zone punishes
    greed. Deep tier: expect basin pockets, salvage traps, and local hotspots, extract
    only what justifies the risk, and leave cleanly.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is brine bowl or vent pocket. This slot should
    read through sunken bowl marked by luminous chemical haze; use bowls and hotspot
    rims to remember loops.
